# GRUB SHIFT: a hivebug with its drone beside it can't be hurt, squashed or
# popped by OVERDRIVE, but it can be shoved, even into a pit. Once it is
# shoved away from its drone, the drone dies and the hivebug is fair game.
# A drone shoved into sour pods turns into a larva.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 7 0
cheat bug 1 1 2 1
cheat sour 2 2 1
cheat chip 5 0
cheat use 5 1 2
expect lv_at22 == 0
expect drones == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat elev 0 2 1
cheat bug 1 2 2 1
cheat bug 1 1 7 0
cheat use 0 1 2
expect kills == 0
expect bug_at22 == 2
expect drones == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 2 1
cheat bug 1 3 7 0
cheat hole 2 2
cheat use 3 1 2
expect kills == 1
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 2
cheat bug 1 2 2 1
cheat bug 0 1 7 0
cheat chip 6 26
cheat use 6 0 2
cheat use 1 1 2
expect kills == 1
expect drones == 0
expect bug_at22 == 2
cheat use 2 2 2
expect kills == 2
